{"t":"Venore Dragon Lair","s":"venore-dragon-lair-dbe3c","k":"local","i":"assets/wiki/Dragon_24987b.gif","html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Venore Dragon Lair</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"Dragon\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Dragon_24987b.gif\" width=\"64\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"city\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Near city</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Venore\">Venore</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"location\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Location</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">South-west of Venore, <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32804,32148,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32804, 32148, 7)</a>.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"vocation\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Vocation(s)</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">All vocations.</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Level &amp; Skills' Requirements</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"lvlknights\">\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"> <div class=\"skills-box\"> <h3 class=\"skills-box-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-General\">General</span></h3> <div class=\"skills-box-label\">Knights</div> <div class=\"skills-box-data\">Level <span style=\"color: green; font-weight: bold;\">50</span> and 80 / 80 (Attk/Def)</div> <div class=\"skills-box-label\">Paladins</div> <div class=\"skills-box-data\">Level <span style=\"color: green; font-weight: bold;\">55</span> and 75 /  (Attk/Def)</div> <div class=\"skills-box-label\">Mages</div> <div class=\"skills-box-data\">Level <span style=\"color: green; font-weight: bold;\">40</span> and 35 / Fire (ML/Def)</div> </div></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n<caption class=\"pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-secondary-background pi-item-spacing\">Profit Hourly</caption>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"exp\">Experience</th>\n<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"loot\">Loot</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"exp\"><p style=\"text-align: center; color: green\"><b>Good</b></p><p style=\"text-align: center; margin: 0.4em 0 0.5em;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span><br/><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span></p></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"loot\"><p style=\"text-align: center; color: green\"><b>Good</b></p><p style=\"text-align: center; margin: 0.4em 0 0.5em;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span><br/><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group pi-horizontal-group-no-labels\">\n<caption class=\"pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-secondary-background pi-item-spacing\">Notable Loot</caption>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Scale%20Mail\"><img alt=\"Dragon Scale Mail\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Dragon_Scale_Mail_723a12.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot2\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Royal%20Helmet\"><img alt=\"Royal Helmet\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Royal_Helmet_44a9ae.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot3\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Dragon Slayer\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Dragon_Slayer_9866f8.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot4\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Lord%20Trophy\"><img alt=\"Dragon Lord Trophy\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Dragon_Lord_Trophy_23028d.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot5\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Tower%20Shield\"><img alt=\"Tower Shield\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Tower_Shield_ea3208.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Maps and Pictures</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"map\">\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Venore-drags\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"104\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Venore_drags_b0736a.gif\" width=\"125\"/></span> </div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">7.1<br/>December 17, 2002<br/>Christmas Update 2002</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Hunting Places <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p>The Venore dragon lair is one of the biggest and most famous spawns of <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon\">Dragons</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Lord\">Dragon Lords</a>.\n</p><p>The <i>new</i> way to the lair is very short, you only need a <a href=\"#/wiki/Machete\">Machete</a> or similar tool to cut Venorean Spice. The lair is situated <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32804,32148,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32804, 32148, 7)</a>. The new entrance is <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32837,32141,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32837, 32141, 7)</a>, through 3 venorean spice map-squares that need to be cut down just southwest of the western gate of Venore.\n</p><p>The <i>original</i> way to the lair was long, and you would encounter many <a href=\"#/wiki/Scorpion\">Scorpions</a> as well as would have to walk through many fire fields if you did not bring <a href=\"#/wiki/Destroy%20Field\">Destroy Field</a> runes. You would also need some parcels or <a href=\"#/wiki/Levitate\">Levitate</a> to get there and back. The original entrance is <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32855,32107,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32855, 32107, 7)</a>, in a hole just north of the western gate of Venore.\n</p><p><br/>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Hunting_Strategies\">Hunting Strategies</span></h2>\n<p><i>Knights</i>: It is a very large and fast spawn, so it should be very\ngood for high level knights that choose to hunt solo. It is recommended\nthat they bring a few backpacks of <a href=\"#/wiki/Mana%20Potion\">Mana Potions</a>.\n</p><p>It is not advisable to go solo if you are a low level knight, because\nspawns usually come up two or three at a time. This will be a waste of <a href=\"#/wiki/Health%20Potions\">Health Potions</a> as killing the dragons will be very slow and probably inefficient. If the knight wants to go for blocking then a small team of two or three shooters would be suitable for that purpose.\n</p><p><i>Mages and Paladins</i>: For low level mages or paladins it is strongly advisable to go there with a group and a blocker. Summons will not be so useful as most of the spawns are up in towers or underground. It is recommended that they bring many backpacks of <a href=\"#/wiki/Icicle%20Rune\">Icicle runes</a> and a large supply of bolts/arrows/spears. Also a few backpacks of <a href=\"#/wiki/Mana%20Potion\">Mana Potions</a> for healing spells and of course a wand/rod.\n</p><p>Higher level mages or paladins might choose to go solo and use <a href=\"#/wiki/Icicle%20Rune\">Icicle runes</a> and attack spells (<a href=\"#/wiki/Ice%20Strike\">Ice Strike</a>) to kill the dragons quicker. It is advisable to bring lots of <a href=\"#/wiki/Mana%20Potion\">Mana Potions</a>.\n</p><p>Dragons are skinnable so a useful tool to have would be an <a href=\"#/wiki/Obsidian%20Knife\">Obsidian Knife</a> \nto <a href=\"#/wiki/Skinning\">obtain</a> <a href=\"#/wiki/Red%20Dragon%20Leather\">red</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Green%20Dragon%20Leather\">green dragon leathers</a>. Also for low level mages it is \nadvisable to use <a href=\"#/wiki/Magic%20Shield\">magic shield</a> in case the dragon retargets. \nKnights should also remember to use \"exeta res\" to avoid retargeting on members of their team.\n</p><p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Creatures</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Scorpion\"><img alt=\"Scorpion\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Scorpion_20081f.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Scorpion\">Scorpion</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">45</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">45</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">67</td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Scorpion%20Tail\">Scorpion Tail</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Hatchling\"><img alt=\"Dragon Hatchling\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Dragon_Hatchling_61f167.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Hatchling\">Dragon Hatchling</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">185</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">380</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">200 (<span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">55 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Physical_Damage_Icon_356411.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span></span>, <span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">145 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Fire Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Fire_Damage_Icon_7ba5fe.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span></span>)</td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>0-55× <a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coin</a> (common)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Ham\">Dragon Ham</a> (common)</li>\n<li>Dragon's Tail (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Health%20Potion\">Health Potion</a> (very rare)</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Lord%20Hatchling\"><img alt=\"Dragon Lord Hatchling\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Dragon_Lord_Hatchling_50af48.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Lord%20Hatchling\">Dragon Lord Hatchling</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">645</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">750</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">335</td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>1-165× <a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coin</a> (common)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Ham\">Dragon Ham</a> (common)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Green%20Mushroom\">Green Mushroom</a> (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Mana%20Potion\">Mana Potion</a> (rare)</li>\n<li>Magma Boots (very rare)</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon\"><img alt=\"Dragon\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Dragon_24987b.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon\">Dragon</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">700</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">1,000</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">430 (<span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">120 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Physical_Damage_Icon_356411.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span></span>, <span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">310 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Fire Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Fire_Damage_Icon_7ba5fe.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span></span>)</td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>1-105× <a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coin</a> (common)</li>\n<li>1-3× <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Ham\">Dragon Ham</a> (common)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Steel%20Shield\">Steel Shield</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Crossbow\">Crossbow</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li>Dragon's Tail (uncommon)</li>\n<li>1-10× <a href=\"#/wiki/Burst%20Arrow\">Burst Arrow</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Longsword\">Longsword</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Steel%20Helmet\">Steel Helmet</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Broadsword\">Broadsword</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Plate%20Legs\">Plate Legs</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Green%20Dragon%20Leather\">Green Dragon Leather</a> (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Wand%20of%20Inferno\">Wand of Inferno</a> (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Strong%20Health%20Potion\">Strong Health Potion</a> (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Green%20Dragon%20Scale\">Green Dragon Scale</a> (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Double%20Axe\">Double Axe</a> (rare)</li>\n<li>Dragon Hammer (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Serpent%20Sword\">Serpent Sword</a> (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Small%20Diamond\">Small Diamond</a> (very rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Shield\">Dragon Shield</a> (very rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Life%20Crystal\">Life Crystal</a> (very rare)</li>\n<li>Dragonbone Staff (very rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Trophy\">Dragon Trophy</a> (very rare)</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Lord\"><img alt=\"Dragon Lord\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Dragon_Lord_c599c2.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Lord\">Dragon Lord</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">2,100</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">1,900</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">670 (<span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">230 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Physical_Damage_Icon_356411.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span></span>, <span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">440 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Fire Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Fire_Damage_Icon_7ba5fe.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span></span>)</td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>1-245× <a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coin</a> (common)</li>\n<li>1-5× <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Ham\">Dragon Ham</a> (common)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Green%20Mushroom\">Green Mushroom</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Book%20%28Gemmed%29\">Book (Gemmed)</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li>1-3× Royal Spear (uncommon)</li>\n<li>1-7× <a href=\"#/wiki/Power%20Bolt\">Power Bolt</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Energy%20Ring\">Energy Ring</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Small%20Sapphire\">Small Sapphire</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Golden%20Mug\">Golden Mug</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Red%20Dragon%20Scale\">Red Dragon Scale</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Red%20Dragon%20Leather\">Red Dragon Leather</a> (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Strong%20Health%20Potion\">Strong Health Potion</a> (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Life%20Crystal\">Life Crystal</a> (rare)</li>\n<li>Strange Helmet (very rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Sword\">Fire Sword</a> (very rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Royal%20Helmet\">Royal Helmet</a> (very rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Tower%20Shield\">Tower Shield</a> (very rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Scale%20Mail\">Dragon Scale Mail</a> (very rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Lord%20Trophy\">Dragon Lord Trophy</a> (very rare)</li>\n<li>Dragon Slayer (very rare)</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-New_Route\">New Route</span></h2>\n<p>Required Equipment:\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Machete\">Machete</a> or similar instrument</li></ul>\n<p>Simply get to Venore's southwestern entrance, go to place marked below, then you have to use a <a href=\"#/wiki/Machete\">Machete</a> <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Machete\"><img alt=\"Machete\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Machete_7103b4.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> or other instrument on 3 Venorean Spices <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Venorean Spice\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"46\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Venorean_Spice_bfa577.gif\" width=\"46\"/></span></span> and you're in!\n</p>\n<center><div class=\"minimap mobile-hidden minimap-zoom-2\" style=\"overflow:hidden;display: inline-block;\"><div style=\"overflow:hidden; border: #3366CC 1px solid; position:relative; display: block;image-rendering: crisp-edges;image-rendering: optimizeSpeed;image-rendering: -moz-crisp-edges;image-rendering: -webkit-optimize-contrast;image-rendering: pixelated;-ms-interpolation-mode: nearest-neighbor;width: 256px; height: 256px;\">\n<div class=\"map_image_crop mobile-hidden\" style=\"overflow:hidden; position:absolute; top: -2202px;left:-2058px;clip:rect(2202px 2314px 2458px 2058px);\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Minimap Floor 7\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"4096\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Minimap_Floor_7_10ea82.png\" width=\"5120\"/></span></span>\n<p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"position:absolute;display:block;height:256px;width:128px;left:0px;top:0px;border-right:1px dashed #FFFFFF;\"></div><div style=\"position:absolute;display:block;height:128px;width:256px;left:0px;top:0px;border-bottom:1px dashed #FFFFFF;\"></div>\n</div><div style=\"text-align:right;background-color:#DDDDDD;padding:0px 3px;\"><div class=\"minimap_clic\"><a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32837,32141,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">Browse Map (32837, 32141, 7)</a><div class=\"minimap_wp minimap_w\"></div></div></div></div></center>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Original_Route\">Original Route</span></h2>\n<p>Required Equipment:\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Shovel\">Shovel</a> or similar instrument</li></ul>\n<p>Recommended:\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Cure%20Poison\">Antidote</a> (spell or rune)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Destroy%20Field%20Rune\">Destroy Field Runes</a></li></ul>\n<p>First of all travel to the entrance <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32856,32165,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32856, 32165, 7)</a>, you have to use a <a href=\"#/wiki/Shovel\">Shovel</a> or other instrument on the <a href=\"#/wiki/Loose%20Stone%20Pile\">hole</a> to go down.\n</p><p>Now follow these paths\n</p><p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Venore Dragon Lair 6\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"120\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Venore_Dragon_Lair_6_972456.png\" width=\"109\"/></span>\n</p><p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Venore Dragon Lair 7\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"81\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Venore_Dragon_Lair_7_0164cb.png\" width=\"74\"/></span>\n</p><p>This is the part where you have to walk through fire fields or destroy them using some <a href=\"#/wiki/Destroy%20Field\">destroy field</a> runes.\n</p><p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Venore Dragon Lair 8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"100\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Venore_Dragon_Lair_8_acfa51.png\" width=\"192\"/></span>\n</p><p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Venore Dragon Lair 9\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"106\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Venore_Dragon_Lair_9_955f6d.png\" width=\"94\"/></span>\n</p><p>Go up one of the three holes and you will have reached the lair\n</p><p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Venore Dragon Lair 10\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"155\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Venore_Dragon_Lair_10_d0b6f8.png\" width=\"168\"/></span>\n</p><p>Take caution when going up as you might encounter up to 2 <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon\">Dragons</a> at once.\n</p><p>Note: Since Updates/9.8 the route is a little shorter, before this update you had to enter a hole <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32804,32148,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32804, 32148, 7)</a> and follow these maps:\n<span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Venore Dragon Lair 1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"187\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Venore_Dragon_Lair_1_426c09.png\" width=\"138\"/></span>\n</p><p>Go up the hole then go up the ramp and cross the bridge until you come to a dead end. There you will have to use either parcels/pots or <a href=\"#/wiki/Levitate\">Levitate</a> to get down, then go down the hole to your right\n</p><p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Venore Dragon Lair 2\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"43\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Venore_Dragon_Lair_2_5b3e9f.png\" width=\"42\"/></span>\n<span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Venore Dragon Lair 3\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"110\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Venore_Dragon_Lair_3_2ba297.png\" width=\"104\"/></span>\n<span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Venore Dragon Lair 4\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"56\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Venore_Dragon_Lair_4_7ffe0e.png\" width=\"76\"/></span>\n<span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Venore Dragon Lair 5\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"103\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Venore_Dragon_Lair_5_1eaa51.png\" width=\"96\"/></span>\n</p></div>","quests":[]}